  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fxaeros-world-map-excalibur-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur-xaeros-world-map-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\"></a></p><hr><p>一個<strong>非官方相容包</strong>，旨在將 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's World Map</a> 模組的美術風格與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 資源包統一。此包<strong>已完成100%</strong>，包含：</p><ul>\n<li>重新設計所有GUI按鈕。</li>\n<li>移除右上角的東南西北指示。</li>\n<li>支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/open-parties-and-claims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open Parties and Claims</a>。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>注意事項：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>為獲得最佳體驗，請將此包與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 一同使用。</li>\n<li>如有錯誤回報或建議，請透過 <strong>Discord (@thedatthai)</strong> 私訊我。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>致謝：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/maffhew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Maffhew</a> - Excalibur 的創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xaero96\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">xaero96</a> - Xaero's World Map 的創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/grandpappyjay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GrandPappyJay</a> - 在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clarent-excalibur-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clarent Edition</a> 中負責路徑點與指標的紋理陰影</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tc_/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TC_</a> - 縮圖的靈感來源</li>\n</ul>",
